Usage: jsonschema-cli [COMMAND]

Commands:
  validate      Validate JSON instances against a JSON Schema
  bundle        Bundle a JSON Schema into a Compound Schema Document
  dereference   Dereference a JSON Schema, inlining all $ref targets
  canonicalize  Canonicalize a JSON Schema to its simplified canonical form
  help          Print this message or the help of the given subcommand(s)

Options:
  -V, --version  Print version
  -h, --help     Print help
